$$
m = \frac{Q}{c\Delta T} = \frac{8.4 \times 10^4}{4.2 \times 10^3 \times (50 - 40)} = \frac{8.4 \times 10^4}{4.2 \times 10^4} = 2 \text{ kg}
$$  
